# Scheduled jobs (D-84), run by supercronic in the `scheduler` container (times in UTC).
# Every command takes an advisory lock, so an overlapping or manual run is skipped.
# Syntax: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command

# Monthly partitions of audit.audit_log and audit.access_log, three months ahead.
10 3 * * * paz audit ensure-partitions
# ARCO: anonymize persons whose retention period ended (D-69).
30 3 * * * paz people purge
# Peace Movement aggregates: pending network changes every minute, full recompute nightly.
* * * * * paz peace-movement aggregate
45 3 * * * paz peace-movement aggregate --full
